{"id": "2312514", "name": "מד״ר פרידה – y ln(y) עם תנאי התחלה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_SEPARABLE_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">מצאו את הפתרון החיובי של בעיית ההתחלה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 8px;\">\\(\\displaystyle y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px; color: #665f6b; font-size: 14px;\">המשוואה נבחנת בתחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y&gt;0\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle y({{CT:3}})=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_SEPARABLE_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>מאחר ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y&gt;0\\)</span> ומתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}\\neq1\\)</span>, מפרידים משתנים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{dy}{y\\ln y}=2{{CT:4}}\\frac{t}{t^2+{{CT:5}}^2}\\,dt\\)</div>\n<p>אינטגרציה נותנת</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln|\\ln y|={{CT:4}}\\ln(t^2+{{CT:5}}^2)+C\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן ניתן לכתוב</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln y=K(t^2+{{CT:5}}^2)^{{{CT:4}}}\\)</div>\n<p>בנקודת ההתחלה מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle t_0^2={{CT:5}}^2\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln y_0={{CT:6}}\\)</span>. מכאן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle K=\\frac{{{CT:6}}}{(2{{CT:5}}^2)^{{{CT:4}}}}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן הפתרון הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">\\(\\displaystyle y(t)={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:Result]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 42, "insertstars": 5, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "ביטוי ב-t", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "intv:ev(ans1,ev(var)=t0);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.7, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "intv", "tans": "y0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.3, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "correctanswer", "eps", "ode", "q", "r", "t0", "var", "y0"], "nvariants": 50}